  "title": { "zh": "遮光闸下的夜航灯", "en": "The Light Behind the Shutter" },
  "concept": { "zh": "锁门遮光 · 双钥匙 · 南北渡口", "en": "Beam shutter · Two keys · Crossings" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "从东库带走夜航灯，送回南码头。北钥匙开灯箱，也会升起挡在西侧激光前的遮光闸。闸门一开，通电的激光便横穿南北之间的整条水道。南钥匙开东库门。南侧踏板让激光断电到本局结束。开箱用一回合。航船在第 28 回合结束时离开。",
    "en": "Bring the night lantern from the east vault to the south dock. The north key unlocks its chest and raises the shutter in front of the west laser. With the shutter raised, the powered beam spans the entire crossing. The south key unlocks the east vault door. The southern plate cuts laser power for the rest of the run. Opening the chest takes one turn. The boat leaves at the end of turn 28."
  },
